        "prior_work": "Opioid-induced arrhythmia is hypothesized through known mechanisms of opioid effects on cardiac electrophysiology, promotion of sleep apnea with consequent hypoxia, and drug interactions. The seven confounders and precision variables selected reflect established cardiovascular risk factors, chronic pain comorbidities, and factors affecting opioid prescribing.",
